 s and behavior. An AI paper belongs here through its contribution to unde
 rstanding cognition\, not solely through a predictive performance improve
 ment.\nAdditional topics: \nScope sources (2026): https://cognitivescienc
 esociety.org/submissions-faq/\, https://cognitivesciencesociety.org/\nSco
 pe last checked: 2026-10-07
